<title>BAHRAIN: Peregrine to close Gulf branch.</title>
<headline>Peregrine to close Gulf branch.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian investment bank Peregrine Investments Holdings Ltd is closing its Gulf office in Bahrain as part of its global reorganisation, its manager was quoted on Tuesday as saying.</p>
<p>Gulf Daily News newspaper quoted Pervaiz Baig as saying management of the Gulf client base would be moved to London and Hong Kong and that the bank stopped trading on December 31.</p>
<p>He said administrative procedures and the transfer of accounts were under way.</p>
<p>The firm opened its Gulf office in Bahrain, the Gulf's banking centre, three years ago.</p>
</text>
